## Smallest interesting prototype

- One scenario (this one)
- 4 players, locked prompts, BYOK
- 30 rounds, 1 inference per minute (or compressed for first tests)
- Three event types (competitor release, GPU shortage, viral incident)
- Headless agent loop writing to event log
- Replay viewer: score graph + key events + each agent's reasoning trace at decision points

If watching that replay is fun, scaling up is worth building. If it's boring, event design needs more work before scaling.
